B.bPd=new A.kK("message",'Write your reply into the conversation, one part at a time. Call this once per part, in the order the parts should appear. Use kind "speech" for the words you say, and kind "action" for your own movement or stage direction. These calls are the only way your reply reaches the reader \u2014 a turn that never calls this cannot be sent. Write each part as plain text: the call already names the kind, so never wrap an action in asterisks and never write a kind label like [speech] or [action] yourself. Write your closing line before you stop.',B.byX,!1,!0,!0,B.j9)
B.Mw={type:0,properties:1}
